        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 6010, Traditional Oval Beaded Entry Door Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Oval Beaded Entry Door Lockset is great for traditional homes. This ornate handleset has a classic look that makes it timeless. The Traditional Oval Beaded Entry Door Lockset makes the kind of first impression you want your front door to make to all of your visitors, speaking for both elegance and style. It will fit standard 2-1/8 inch door preparations with door thicknesses ranging from 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick and with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from single cylinder or dummy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Ornate Entry Door Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass latch with saw-proof insert.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Oval Beaded 8 Inch Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Spacing (distance between deadbolt and lever latch): 5-5/8\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-6010-specifications.pdf?v=1704262348\"><b>Emtek 6010 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob/lever operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-6010-finish.jpg?v=1704354690\" width=\"431\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 6010 Available Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Oval Beaded Entry Door Lockset",
                "description": "The Oval Beaded Entry Door Lockset is great for traditional homes. This ornate handleset has a classic look that makes it timeless. The Traditional Oval Beaded Entry Door Lockset makes the kind of first impression you want your front door to make to all of your visitors, speaking for both elegance and style. It will fit standard 2-1/8 inch door preparations with door thicknesses ranging from 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick and with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from single cylinder or dummy functions.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Oval Beaded Sideplate Locksets, Oval Beaded Entry Door Locksets, Emtek 6010, Emtek 6015, Traditional Oval Beaded Entry Door Locksets, Traditional handlesets, Ornate Entry Door Locksets, Emtek Oval Beaded 8 Inch Entry Sets, colonial handlesets, Emtek 6011, EMT-6010,"
